<title>BRAZIL: RESEARCH ALERT-Brazil Copene still a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Brazil Copene still a buy.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fator Securities said it was maintaining its buy rating on Brazilian petrochemical firm Copene Petroquimica do Nordeste despite the share's recent rally.</p>
<p>- also said its target price for 1997 is 600 reais.</p>
<p>- Analyst Juan Tseng said the company's results could outperform Fator's projections &quot;should Copene's product pricing spread continue wide or expand relative to naphta prices.&quot;</p>
<p>- Copene voting shares were up 5.26 percent at 400 reais on the Sao Paulo bolsa earlier.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
